            "detailed_description": "What if you had to get a hole-in-one on every hole? <strong>Fantasy Fairways</strong> is a golf game where you design your own path to the hole. Bounce the ball off trampolines,  zoom through different power ups, even take it through wormholes -- several gizmos let you express yourself. The game is all about balancing your own creativity and skill. Design the hole of your dreams and carefully aim the perfect ace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552690/extras/6cacb1a2a09112d15e0fdedaca8cead2.avif?t=1565280048\" width=556 height=139 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Course Mode:</strong> Play through nine holes of the game at once and try to get the best score possible.<br></li><li><strong>Puzzle Mode:</strong> Play and unlock individual levels at your leisure.<br></li><li><strong>Random Mode:</strong> Play through a random nine holes from any of the courses in the game.<br></li><li><strong>Timed Mode:</strong> Beat a course in as little time as possible.<br></li><li><strong>Multiple Courses:</strong> There are three courses (9 holes each) in the game. Dream Links, Lucid Lake, and Crystal Peaks.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552690/extras/94a5fe1ed5ab987891df793beb39a6ce.avif?t=1565280048\" width=556 height=139 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fancy Balls:</strong> Every level and course has several ways to unlock new customization options for your ball.<br></li><li><strong>Cheat Codes:</strong> Hidden secrets are everywhere that unlock more fancy balls for you to use.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "What if you had to get a hole-in-one on every hole? <strong>Fantasy Fairways</strong> is a golf game where you design your own path to the hole. Bounce the ball off trampolines,  zoom through different power ups, even take it through wormholes -- several gizmos let you express yourself. The game is all about balancing your own creativity and skill. Design the hole of your dreams and carefully aim the perfect ace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552690/extras/6cacb1a2a09112d15e0fdedaca8cead2.avif?t=1565280048\" width=556 height=139 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Course Mode:</strong> Play through nine holes of the game at once and try to get the best score possible.<br></li><li><strong>Puzzle Mode:</strong> Play and unlock individual levels at your leisure.<br></li><li><strong>Random Mode:</strong> Play through a random nine holes from any of the courses in the game.<br></li><li><strong>Timed Mode:</strong> Beat a course in as little time as possible.<br></li><li><strong>Multiple Courses:</strong> There are three courses (9 holes each) in the game. Dream Links, Lucid Lake, and Crystal Peaks.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552690/extras/94a5fe1ed5ab987891df793beb39a6ce.avif?t=1565280048\" width=556 height=139 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fancy Balls:</strong> Every level and course has several ways to unlock new customization options for your ball.<br></li><li><strong>Cheat Codes:</strong> Hidden secrets are everywhere that unlock more fancy balls for you to use.</li></ul>",
